<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Thank you for your enquiry regarding the transport of your pet with Qantas Freight.<br />
<br />
Crates are not included in the price. The cost covers the pet's flight only, and customers are required to provide their own crate. Crates can be hired from <b>pet travel companies</b>, simply give them a call and ask for an IATA (airline approved) crate. Some crates are also sold at major airport freight terminals, however this is subject to stock levels and availability.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
More information on crates can be found <a href="https://freight.qantas.com/pets/crates.html">here</a>.<br />
<br />
If you have any further queries please contact our customer service team on 13 12 13.
